<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi National Co for Glass details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Saudi National Co for Glass details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit	     15.9    vs    18.1</p>
<p> Sales income	  114.6    vs   103.8</p>
<p> Sales expenses	 76.8    vs    66.6</p>
<p> Operating income     37.7    vs    37.2</p>
<p> Other income	    1.2    vs     2.1</p>
<p> Other expenses	 20.7    vs    19.7</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 18.2    vs    19.7</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 223.8    vs   195.8</p>
<p> Assets		  322.5    vs   314.4</p>
<p>Full Name: National Company for Glass Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
